secubox-soc-gateway (1.1.1-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * LECTURE GARDEE (#1256). Les routes d'affichage de ce module — status,
    components, access, stats — repondaient sans authentification : c'etait le
    motif « three-fold » du parc, un choix assume, mais une lecture publique
    reste de la reconnaissance offerte. Elles passent sous
    `require_lecture` : jeton, OU mode tableau de bord depuis le LAN si
    l'operateur l'a arme dans /etc/secubox/secubox.conf.
  * Le defaut est FERME : sans `[tableau_de_bord] actif = true`, ces routes
    exigent un jeton, y compris depuis le LAN.
  * Les sondes de sante restent publiques. Les routes deja sous require_jwt ne
    changent pas — le mode ne les ouvre jamais.

 -- Gerald Kerma <devel@cybermind.fr>  Thu, 10 Sep 2026 23:55:00 +0200

secubox-soc-gateway (1.1.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Phase 5: Hierarchical Mode Implementation
  * New features:
    - Mode configuration (edge/regional/central)
    - Regional SOC enrollment and token management
    - Regional-to-central aggregation with signed push
    - Cross-region threat correlation
    - Global summary and regional breakdown APIs
    - Multi-tier hierarchy support
  * API endpoints added:
    - GET /hierarchy/status
    - POST /hierarchy/mode
    - POST /regional/token
    - POST /regional/enroll
    - POST /regional/ingest
    - GET /regional/socs
    - POST /upstream/enroll
    - GET /upstream/status
    - GET /global/summary
    - GET /global/regions
    - GET /global/threats

 -- Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>  Tue, 01 Apr 2026 15:30:00 +0200

secubox-soc-gateway (1.0.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Implements SOC Gateway for fleet monitoring
  * Features:
    - Node registration with HMAC enrollment tokens
    - Fleet-wide metrics aggregation
    - Unified alert stream from all nodes
    - Cross-node threat correlation
    - Remote command execution with audit
    - WebSocket real-time updates
    - Hierarchical deployment support

